From a290d7ebdbdffe81ec3e8a467e95d03bd0632603 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Van Tran <trantoanvan@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:33:49 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(workflow): cap how often agents send an issue back

A workflow may set max_send_backs (GET/PUT /api/issue-workflows/{id}/limits,
table vantt_workflow_limit). An agent moving an issue along a step's back
edge after that many agent send-backs with no person's status move in
between gets 409 {code: send_back_limit}; the batch endpoint skips it. A
person's move is never refused and starts a fresh count. No limit set =
upstream behaviour.

Patch-Id: send-back-limit
